\section*{Superlinear Circuit Lower Bounds for Explicit Boolean Functions}

\subsection{OpenAI's claim}
OpenAI presents the following claims relevant to this question, with manuscript numbers following paper order in Sources. In manuscript 1 (family 112; 2026-09-23), the asserted result is that one polynomial-time language eventually needs more than $2^{A\sqrt n}$ depth-three OR--AND--OR gates for every fixed $A$.

\subsection{Mathematical statement of the claimed result}
\paragraph{Manuscript 1.}
The claim constructs one language $L\subseteq\{0,1\}^*$ decidable by a fixed deterministic Turing machine in polynomial time. For its length-$n$ Boolean function $f_n$ and minimum size $S_3(f_n)$ of circuits with three successive unbounded-fan-in layers OR--AND--OR, literal inputs and optional bottom constants, and free input negations, it asserts
\[
 \lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{\log_2S_3(f_n)}{\sqrt n}=\infty,
 \quad\text{equivalently}\quad
 \forall A>0\ \exists N_A\ \forall n\ge N_A:\ S_3(f_n)>2^{A\sqrt n}.
\]
The circuit family may be nonuniform, and there is no bound on bottom fan-in. The size counts every AND or OR gate, including gates in the bottom layer and the output gate.

\subsection{Outline of the argument}
For manuscript 1 (family 112; 2026-09-23), a random restriction expresses moderately wide CNFs as signed combinations of constant-width CNFs with controlled total coefficient mass. A fixed hard-slice language has low correlation with those tests, so no bounded number of middle gates can cover its positive inputs.

\subsection{Scope relative to this problem}
The lower bound is for the depth-three OR--AND--OR model with its stated gate conventions. This problem allows unrestricted binary circuits, and a depth-restricted lower bound does not give the requested general circuit separation.

\subsection{Formal verification}
For manuscript 1 (family 112; 2026-09-23), OpenAI lists Lean statements for this assertion: one polynomial-time language eventually needs more than $2^{A\sqrt n}$ depth-three OR--AND--OR gates for every fixed $A$.

This coverage does not establish a formal proof of the complete problem as stated here.

The linked family Comparator checks are \texttt{DepthThree.lean}.

Their named declarations include \texttt{OAI.DepthThreeLowerBound.exists\_polynomial\_time\_language\_depth\_three\_lower\_bound}.

This site has not executed the Lean code. Described statement coverage is not an independent proof check.

\subsection{Status caveat}
The manuscripts were produced by an internal OpenAI model. OpenAI cautions that results without formalization can contain mistakes. This site has not independently checked the proofs; the label records the scope of OpenAI's claim.

\subsection{Sources}
\begin{itemize}
\item OpenAI, \emph{Beyond the Square-Root Exponent for Depth-Three Boolean Circuits}, 2026-09-23; citation key \texttt{OAI:Beyond-the-Square-Root-Exponent-for-Depth-Three-Boolean-Circuits-September-23-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Beyond-the-Square-Root-Exponent-for-Depth-Three-Boolean-Circuits-September-23-2026/main.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Beyond-the-Square-Root-Exponent-for-Depth-Three-Boolean-Circuits-September-23-2026/main.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Beyond-the-Square-Root-Exponent-for-Depth-Three-Boolean-Circuits-September-23-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Beyond-the-Square-Root-Exponent-for-Depth-Three-Boolean-Circuits-September-23-2026/main.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Beyond-the-Square-Root-Exponent-for-Depth-Three-Boolean-Circuits-September-23-2026/build/latex/sections/00\_introduction.tex\#L21}{thm:main}.
\item Family 112: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/112.md}{Lean scope}.
\item \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/ComparatorChallenges/DepthThree.json}{Comparator DepthThree.json}.
\item \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/ComparatorChallenges/DepthThree.lean}{Comparator DepthThree.lean}.
\item \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/CONTENTS.md}{OpenAI catalogue entry}.
\end{itemize}
